OL,3,GNEWSANurse struck off for relationship
OL,4,Awith patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mental health nurse has been struck
OL,7,Foff the register after getting into a
OL,8,Fromantic relationship with a vulnerable
OL,9,Fpatient.
OL,11,FNatalie Croarkin's relationship with
OL,12,FPatient A began in 2015.
OL,14,FOver a two-year period, she repeatedly
OL,15,Faccessed the patient's records without
OL,16,Fclinical need, and lied about the
OL,17,Frelationship during an internal
OL,18,Finvestigation in 2022 by the Lancashire
OL,19,Fand South Cumbria NHS Foundation Trust.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
