OL,3,GNEWSANurse struck off for relationship
OL,4,Awith patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a two-day fitness to practice
OL,7,Fhearing, the Nursing and Midwifery
OL,8,FCouncil (NMC) ruled she should be
OL,9,Fstruck off the register and an 18-month
OL,10,Finterim suspension order was issued in
OL,11,Fthe case of an appeal.
